  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463324",
      "title": "Adding a \"Special Attack\"",
      "lectureOrder": 55,
      "videoOrder": 49,
      "sourceHash": "8d1a406a144a613b2ca06be3796be4a86cec3fb3a1bf7e3b45bc235599595287",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 4.11,
          "en": "Now that the attack button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.11,
          "end": 6.61,
          "en": "and the attack action is working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.61,
          "end": 8.71,
          "en": "let's implement the next action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.71,
          "end": 10.34,
          "en": "we wanna support in this game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.34,
          "end": 12.63,
          "en": "And that is the special attack action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.63,
          "end": 15.513,
          "en": "and therefore the special attack button that should work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.43,
          "end": 19.83,
          "en": "The idea here is relatively simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.83,
          "end": 23.08,
          "en": "I want to do the same as an attack monster,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.08,
          "end": 26.14,
          "en": "but we should deal more damage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.14,
          "end": 29.67,
          "en": "On the other hand and to not make this too powerful,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.67,
          "end": 31.56,
          "en": "the special attack should therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.56,
          "end": 33.59,
          "en": "not be available all the time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.59,
          "end": 36.63,
          "en": "but only every three rounds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.63,
          "end": 39.48,
          "en": "So let's start by adding this method though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.48,
          "end": 41.803,
          "en": "I'll name it specialAttackMonster.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.17,
          "end": 48.17,
          "en": "And in here I want to calculate an attack value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.84,
          "end": 53.84,
          "en": "but let's say between 10 and 25 damage points.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.93,
          "end": 57.363,
          "en": "So we have the potential to do quite a lot of damage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.76,
          "end": 60.59,
          "en": "Of course, just as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.59,
          "end": 63.16,
          "en": "we then reach out to the monsterHealth",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.16,
          "end": 65.82300000000001,
          "en": "and deduct the attack value from it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.86,
          "end": 69.76,
          "en": "And also just as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.76,
          "end": 73.57,
          "en": "the monster should still attack us back thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.57,
          "end": 77.73,
          "en": "It does not just attack back if we launched a normal attack,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.73,
          "end": 81.41,
          "en": "it also attacks back if we use a special attack.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.41,
          "end": 84.819,
          "en": "So here we call attackPlayer, thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.819,
          "end": 87.088,
          "en": "to make sure that we as a player",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.088,
          "end": 87.92099999999999,
          "en": "are attacked after we launched a special attack.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.07,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "Now, with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 97.36,
          "en": "we can connect this special attack button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.36,
          "end": 100.3,
          "en": "Again, by adding a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.3,
          "end": 104.6,
          "en": "and then by pointing at the specialAttackMonster method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.6,
          "end": 105.763,
          "en": "we just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.99000000000001,
          "end": 108.38,
          "en": "And if we saved that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.38,
          "end": 111.43,
          "en": "and save the JavaScript file and reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.43,
          "end": 115.03999999999999,
          "en": "If I click special attack, I'm doing a lot of damage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.03999999999999,
          "end": 118.45,
          "en": "to the monster, as you can tell by its quickly shrinking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.45,
          "end": 120.23,
          "en": "monster health bar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.23,
          "end": 124.16,
          "en": "But the problem is, that right now we can spam this attack.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.16,
          "end": 127.52,
          "en": "So winning would not be too hard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.52,
          "end": 131.98,
          "en": "because we can press the same button over and over again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.98,
          "end": 135.23,
          "en": "And therefore I wanna restrict this powerful attack.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.23,
          "end": 138.99,
          "en": "It should only be available every three rounds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.99,
          "end": 141.32999999999998,
          "en": "And when it's not available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.32999999999998,
          "end": 143.793,
          "en": "this button therefore should be disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.79,
          "end": 146.14,
          "en": "So how could we implement that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.14,
          "end": 149.163,
          "en": "How could we make sure that this is the way it works?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.38,
          "end": 152.28,
          "en": "Well, we could keep track",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.28,
          "end": 156.15,
          "en": "of the number of rounds the game is already lasting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.15,
          "end": 158.62,
          "en": "For that we can add a new data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.62,
          "end": 160.4,
          "en": "because we got a new piece of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.4,
          "end": 164.07999999999998,
          "en": "we wanna change and update and be aware of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.07999999999998,
          "end": 166.72,
          "en": "and I'll name this, currentRound.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.72,
          "end": 169.16,
          "en": "I'll add it here to the data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.16,
          "end": 173.24,
          "en": "and not add it as a regular JavaScript variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.24,
          "end": 176.53,
          "en": "for example, because we'll need access to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.53,
          "end": 178.36,
          "en": "from inside the view instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.36,
          "end": 181.75,
          "en": "and view needs to be aware of when it changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.75,
          "end": 183.04,
          "en": "And that is all the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.04,
          "end": 186.093,
          "en": "if something is a data property in the view app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.15,
          "end": 188.71,
          "en": "So now we got the current round,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.71,
          "end": 192.59,
          "en": "we start at zero and I wanna increment that round,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.59,
          "end": 195.56,
          "en": "of course, whenever we do anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.56,
          "end": 197.44,
          "en": "So whenever we attack and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.44,
          "end": 200.623,
          "en": "Whenever that happens, the round should change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.48,
          "end": 204.29,
          "en": "So therefore, for example, when we attack the monster,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.29,
          "end": 206.77,
          "en": "I'll set this current round, plus plus,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.77,
          "end": 208.92000000000002,
          "en": "to increment it by one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.92000000000002,
          "end": 210.84,
          "en": "When the monster attacks us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.84,
          "end": 212.12,
          "en": "I'll not do it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.12,
          "end": 214.88,
          "en": "because that will still be the same round, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 214.88,
          "end": 217.86,
          "en": "The monster attacks us whenever we did something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.86,
          "end": 220.11,
          "en": "so we don't need to change the round again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.11,
          "end": 221.56,
          "en": "when that happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 221.56,
          "end": 223.01,
          "en": "But we need to change it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 223.01,
          "end": 226.14,
          "en": "when we launch a special attack, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 226.14,
          "end": 228.67000000000002,
          "en": "So now we got this current round,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 228.67000000000002,
          "end": 232.163,
          "en": "how can we now use it to control the special attack button?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 233.37,
          "end": 236.44,
          "en": "Well, we can go back to index.html",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 236.44,
          "end": 240.36,
          "en": "and disable the button if the current round",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.36,
          "end": 243.233,
          "en": "is not dividable by three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 244.1,
          "end": 247.89,
          "en": "That makes sure that we can only use it every three rounds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 247.89,
          "end": 251.9,
          "en": "To achieve this, we can set the disabled attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 251.9,
          "end": 254.3,
          "en": "of a button, but of course not like that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.3,
          "end": 257.11,
          "en": "but instead to a dynamic value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 257.11,
          "end": 259.92,
          "en": "and we can do that on attributes as you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 259.92,
          "end": 264.92,
          "en": "with v-bind or again, this short hand of just :disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 266.23,
          "end": 269.4,
          "en": "And I want to set this to true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 269.4,
          "end": 272.18,
          "en": "And true or false should be derived",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.18,
          "end": 274.31,
          "en": "based on the current round.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 274.31,
          "end": 276.57,
          "en": "So here we can access current round,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.57,
          "end": 280.557,
          "en": "so this current round data property we added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 280.557,
          "end": 284.43,
          "en": "And use the modulus operator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 284.43,
          "end": 286.29,
          "en": "which we have in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 286.29,
          "end": 288.42,
          "en": "to divide it by three and find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 288.42,
          "end": 292.37,
          "en": "what the remainder of this division is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 292.37,
          "end": 296.51,
          "en": "And we know if the remainder is not zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 296.51,
          "end": 299.9,
          "en": "then this was not dividable by three",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 299.9,
          "end": 301.94,
          "en": "and therefore we know we're certainly not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 301.94,
          "end": 304.99,
          "en": "in the third or sixth or ninth round.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 304.99,
          "end": 308.12,
          "en": "And we only want to enable the button in those rounds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 308.12,
          "end": 311.15,
          "en": "So we'll disable it if the division of three",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 311.15,
          "end": 313.683,
          "en": "does not leave a remainder of zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 316.9,
          "end": 318.59,
          "en": "If we saved it and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 318.59,
          "end": 320.37,
          "en": "the special attack's available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 320.37,
          "end": 323.77,
          "en": "but once I clicked it, you'll see it's become gray.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 323.77,
          "end": 327.43,
          "en": "And now I need to do two more normal attacks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 327.43,
          "end": 329.38,
          "en": "before it's enabled again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 329.38,
          "end": 331.81,
          "en": "So this is now working the way it should.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 331.81,
          "end": 336.36,
          "en": "But as so often, I don't necessarily wanna have that logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 336.36,
          "end": 340.24,
          "en": "in my HTML code and therefore I'll cut it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 340.24,
          "end": 344.23,
          "en": "go back to app.js and add a new computed property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 344.23,
          "end": 347.307,
          "en": "which we could name mayUseSpecialAttack",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 349.85,
          "end": 353.72,
          "en": "and in here we simply return this calculation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 353.72,
          "end": 355.52,
          "en": "now using the this keyword though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 355.52,
          "end": 358.12,
          "en": "since we're in the view instance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 358.12,
          "end": 361.75,
          "en": "And with that, we can use the mayUseSpecialAttack",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 361.75,
          "end": 365.04,
          "en": "computed property here, just like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 365.04,
          "end": 367.64,
          "en": "to make sure that the button is disabled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 367.64,
          "end": 370.02,
          "en": "when it should be disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 370.02,
          "end": 371.49,
          "en": "So that's working now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 371.49,
          "end": 372.86,
          "en": "and with that we ensure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 372.86,
          "end": 375.47,
          "en": "that we only have access to the special attack",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 375.47,
          "end": 377.173,
          "en": "every three rounds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 378.27,
          "end": 381.33299999999997,
          "en": "And that's the special attack functionality implemented.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
